            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "This is a built-in mapping in Neovim. See [`:help gs`](https://neovim.io/doc/user/various.html#gs).\r\n\r\nI believe most people remap it to something else, since it's hard to come up with a reason why anyone would want to use the default sleep behaviour in normal mode :slightly_smiling_face: ",
